Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.57,0:00:24.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as there are people\Nwho seek freedom in this life,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.03,0:00:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,these things shall not\Nvanish from the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.73,0:00:37.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People tell me my head's in the clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.61,0:00:40.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care what they say\Nbecause I'm dreaming of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.97,0:00:43.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are the treasure I found.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.65,0:00:46.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So bright, so bold, it's so elusive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.75,0:00:48.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hard to look away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.83,0:00:51.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though it's blinding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.93,0:00:55.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are no words to\Ndescribe how I feel inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.75,0:00:58.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really, really stuck on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.23,0:01:02.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.63,0:01:05.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I won't stop till I\Nget there, you will see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.69,0:01:08.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I need to have\Nthe strength to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.97,0:01:12.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe in wonderland.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.89,0:01:21.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.19,0:01:24.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna share them\Nwith you, a love so true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.25,0:01:27.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I want.\NTogether we can move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.65,0:01:29.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We live how we want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.01,0:01:32.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no limit to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.13,0:01:33.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have the power of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.63,0:01:36.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't want to live ordinary life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.71,0:01:39.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have a chance to live in paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.75,0:01:42.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We believe in one another.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.17,0:01:54.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, Straw Hat Luffy,\Nthis is a good way to die.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:54.99,0:01:57.41,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\bord2.1\c&H161617&\3c&H161617&\1a&HFF&\blur0.5\fad(729,0)\fsp-2\t(687,729,\1a&H00&)}Croc-ish
Dialogue: 2,0:01:54.99,0:01:57.41,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HE7E7E7&\4a&HFF&\blur0.5\fad(729,0)\fsp-2}Croc-ish
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.97,0:02:02.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Within six minutes, this yard will\Nbe blown up along with the square.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.41,0:02:04.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd stay, but I'm in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.55,0:02:06.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just wait right there, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.21,0:02:10.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then you can celebrate the\Nnew king of the sand country.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.93,0:02:13.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.65,0:02:19.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should be on my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.63,0:02:22.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said it's in the Mortuary\NTemple to the west of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.91,0:02:32.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Missed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.99,0:02:45.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was way too close!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.49,0:02:52.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.77,0:02:53.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He took off!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.83,0:02:57.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think he flew off in that direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.65,0:02:59.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He won't get away with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.47,0:03:00.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn him!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:00.85,0:03:05.10,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8\an8\pos(720,45)\fscx80\fscy80\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\b0\bord4.2\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\3a&H25&}Mortuary Temple\N(Royal Mausoleum)\NWest of the Palace
Dialogue: 2,0:03:00.85,0:03:05.10,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\an8\pos(720,45)\fscx80\fscy80\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\b0\bord0\c&HFBFAF9&\4a&HFF&}Mortuary Temple\N(Royal Mausoleum)\NWest of the Palace
Dialogue: 3,0:03:00.85,0:03:05.10,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\an8\pos(720,45)\fscx80\fscy80\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\b0\bord0\c&HFBFAF9&\4a&HFF&}Mortuary Temple\N(Royal Mausoleum)\NWest of the Palace
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.41,0:03:13.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is the royal tomb,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.89,0:03:17.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,where generations of your kings\Nlay in their eternal rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.95,0:03:21.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, where's the Poneglyph?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.93,0:03:35.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hidden Stairs
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.05,0:03:39.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Poneglyph is kept down\Nthere, deep underground
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.85,0:03:43.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Most people aren't even aware\Nof the Poneglyph's existence
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.77,0:03:47.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Many events occur behind the\Nscenes Just because a country
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.77,0:03:50.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,belongs to the world government\NDoesn't necessarily mean
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.71,0:03:54.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that its king knows what's\Ngoing on You shouldn't be blamed
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.03,0:03:56.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like most people,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.35,0:03:58.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you probably had no idea\Nthere was someone left
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.65,0:04:00.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in the world who can\Ndecipher the ancient writing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.85,0:04:02.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can actually read poneglyphs?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.61,0:04:03.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.52,0:04:07.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why Crocodile and I ended\Nup as a team in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.17,0:04:08.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's also why he can't kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.85,0:04:09.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm no use dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.97,0:04:15.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, is it correct that the poneglyph\Nin this country tells where Pluton is?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.63,0:04:17.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that really the case?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.57,0:04:22.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alabasta's royal family has been obligated\Nfor generations now to protect it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.51,0:04:27.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That duty is about the only thing we\Nknow about it protect don't make me laugh
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.19,0:04:36.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place is quite impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.33,0:04:38.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's located behind the doors in the back
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.23,0:04:48.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There it is
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.95,0:04:53.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.49,0:05:00.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you died!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.67,0:05:02.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.01,0:05:03.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What am I doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.92,0:05:06.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to get inside\NCrocodile's head, that's what!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.23,0:05:08.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like if I were him, where would\NI want to shoot a cannon from?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.73,0:05:09.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just keep looking!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.79,0:05:11.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We only have five minutes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.51,0:05:14.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Five minutes to go before\Na million people all die!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.35,0:05:15.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We really need to hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.71,0:05:18.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have much time\Nleft to find the cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.37,0:05:20.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper, do you think you can\Nfind the guy by using your nose?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.79,0:05:21.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.70,0:05:24.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only thing I can smell\Nanywhere is gunpowder.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.15,0:05:25.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.43,0:05:28.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try finding the smell of a guy who's about\Nto blow up the square with a big cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.85,0:05:30.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of smell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.13,0:05:30.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How should I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.05,0:05:31.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just try it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.61,0:05:39.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A cannonball that can\Nblow up that big an area?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.45,0:05:41.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.36,0:05:42.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case, it's gotta be really big.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.81,0:05:46.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if it's gonna be shot out of a\Ncannon, it surely can't go very far.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.31,0:05:49.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it's gotta be closer\Nto the square than this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.81,0:05:50.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.72,0:05:52.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way I have time to go around!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.73,0:05:53.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There, a shortcut!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.83,0:05:57.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything from the sky, Pell?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.59,0:06:01.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I searched every rooftop near the square,\Nbut I couldn't see any sign of a cannon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.37,0:06:04.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, then, it might be\Nin a building somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.57,0:06:05.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, I'll search them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.95,0:06:06.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.73,0:06:21.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How many times must you\Ntry this before giving up?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.21,0:06:34.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crocodile, it's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.85,0:06:39.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like Nico Robin\Nmade short work of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.99,0:06:43.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must say, I never thought the\NMarines would follow me to the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.47,0:06:44.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's your boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.95,0:06:48.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did that smoky idiot run\Naway and leave you all alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.61,0:06:50.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Justice is only for\Nthe people who take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.97,0:06:53.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the kind of world we live in, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.53,0:06:55.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you just go back\Nto your base and talk about
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.73,0:06:58.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,justice until you're actually\Nready to fight for it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.27,0:07:10.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crocodile!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.17,0:07:24.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crocodile! Straw Hat,\Nwhere'd he go, where?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.79,0:07:30.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,tell me right now which way did he go
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.45,0:07:47.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Towards the temple. That way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.41,0:07:50.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That direction! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.55,0:08:06.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What justice is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.89,0:08:15.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To hell with Marine Headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.13,0:08:27.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jeez, I can't move very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.81,0:08:30.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.83,0:08:32.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I ate all that meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.21,0:08:34.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.41,0:08:35.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These wounds are small.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.97,0:08:39.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if I should lie down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.11,0:08:45.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, did it tell you everything\Nthat you wanted to know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.45,0:08:55.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.77,0:08:57.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Secret stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.05,0:09:03.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just four more minutes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.53,0:09:29.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't there any others around?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.41,0:09:31.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this all that your country is hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.95,0:09:33.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You aren't satisfied?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.45,0:09:36.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have kept every word of\Nthe promise I made to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.63,0:09:38.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.71,0:09:42.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like any other national secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.75,0:09:48.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter how hard you look, you can't find\Nit unless you already know where it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.67,0:09:52.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, this is the Poneglyph\Nwe were looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.31,0:09:55.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That didn't take much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.79,0:10:00.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that you have this odd thing in front\Nof you, were you able to decipher it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.83,0:10:02.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes. Very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.71,0:10:03.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, read it aloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.31,0:10:05.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does this thing say?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.35,0:10:11.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kahira conquered Alabasta.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.53,0:10:14.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the Sky Ephemeris, year 239.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.49,0:10:18.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In year 260, Tamer\Nruled the Baton dynasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.17,0:10:23.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In year 306, the Taf Cathedral\Nwas completed in Alabasta.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.49,0:10:28.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In year 325, the hero Mamden\Nof... Hey, hold on! What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.75,0:10:30.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this really all the information here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.91,0:10:33.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't give a damn about\Nthis desert's history.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.93,0:10:35.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to know about the\Nworld's most dangerous
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.83,0:10:38.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,military power that's\Nhiding in this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.37,0:10:40.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is the Pluton hidden?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.29,0:10:43.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That information isn't on here. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.23,0:10:46.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,History is the only thing\Nthat this text contains.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.03,0:10:48.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all? Pluton.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.81,0:10:50.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't see it anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.63,0:10:53.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It isn't mentioned on\Nthis poneglyph at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.55,0:10:57.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not mentioned at all, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.71,0:10:58.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's unfortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.85,0:11:02.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've been an excellent\Npartner, but even so,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.57,0:11:05.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think that I'll kill you right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.21,0:11:07.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.25,0:11:10.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The agreement that we made four\Nyears ago has been fulfilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.31,0:11:13.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you remember the\Nterms of that agreement?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.27,0:11:17.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was to bring you to the\NPoneglyph, and in turn,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.63,0:11:20.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you would hand over the\Ninformation on the weapon to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.09,0:11:24.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The work you've done for Baroque\NWorks these past four years was
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.55,0:11:28.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,excellent both in terms of intellect\Nand your ability to command.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.51,0:11:32.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your usefulness to the company has\Nbeen reason enough to keep you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.73,0:11:35.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But in the end, you've spoiled it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.43,0:11:37.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By betraying me, Nico Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.95,0:11:45.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You say the poneglyph in this country\Ndoesn't say anything at all about Pluton.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.81,0:11:46.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that true? You?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.43,0:11:50.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was this the plan all along to\Nhide the information from me,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.69,0:11:53.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even if you were able to\Nfind something useful?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.63,0:12:01.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But even so, I don't feel\Nany anger toward you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.47,0:12:03.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And do you know why that is, Nico Robin?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.91,0:12:05.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.13,0:12:07.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've worked with you for four years.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.91,0:12:11.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew you'd try something like this\Nsomeday, so I'm more than ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.89,0:12:12.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.15,0:12:16.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you get wet, then a knife\Nshould go right into you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.79,0:12:19.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it! Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.87,0:12:27.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now all is forgiven, Nico Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.23,0:12:39.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I never trusted you from the\Nvery beginning of our partnership.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.75,0:12:42.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew better than to do\Nsomething as foolish as that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.31,0:12:51.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can tell from Cobra's reaction\Nthat Pluton really does exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.99,0:12:53.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't need the Poneglyph.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.83,0:12:55.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can find the Pluton on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.85,0:12:59.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once this country is mine,\Nit's only a matter of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.33,0:13:02.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.29,0:13:05.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's still too early for\Nthe attack on the square.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.69,0:13:07.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must be you. What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.57,0:13:09.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just a little present.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.95,0:13:11.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.27,0:13:14.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this underground temple was built so\Nthat disturbing just one small column
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.73,0:13:18.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,will destroy the balance of the entire\Nstructure and cause it to collapse.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.57,0:13:20.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The two of you are going to die here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.89,0:13:22.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll meet death together.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.41,0:13:26.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am the Twelfth King\Nof the Nefertari family.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.85,0:13:27.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will uphold our honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.97,0:13:31.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone like you can never be\Nallowed to rule the Desert Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.43,0:13:36.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.34,0:13:40.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You truly are a model king, willing to\Ngive your own life just to take me down
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.29,0:13:44.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with you for your kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.15,0:13:46.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Except I won't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.33,0:13:48.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I have to do is\Nchange the rocks to sand
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.01,0:13:52.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I can escape from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.39,0:13:54.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your death will be in vain, Cobra.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.35,0:13:58.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are only three\Nminutes Left when the square
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.11,0:14:01.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,blows up and this temple\Ncollapses everyone standing
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.09,0:14:04.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in my way will be eliminated\Nin an instant and in
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.63,0:14:08.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that moment this land\Nwill become mine entirely?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.97,0:14:35.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three minutes left.\NWhere is it? A cannon big
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.09,0:14:37.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,enough to destroy such\Na large area has to be
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.27,0:14:40.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,enormous there can't be\Nmany places to hide such
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.11,0:14:43.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a weapon so why are we\Nstill unable to find it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.29,0:14:47.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But after all this, open space\Nwhere a cannon would fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.29,0:14:49.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop shooting!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.01,0:14:51.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Open space.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.21,0:14:55.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not fair, Koza.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.73,0:14:57.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hiding in a place like\Nthis the entire time?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.03,0:14:59.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, leader, no fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.45,0:15:02.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, that place would work.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.09,0:15:03.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.00,0:15:05.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you to stop shooting at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.81,0:15:06.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, smoke shark!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.72,0:15:07.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.85,0:15:09.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hidden and it's big.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.21,0:15:10.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it, idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.12,0:15:11.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you I'm not from the Rebel Army!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.97,0:15:16.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Usopp hammer, Usopp\Nrubber, that's your teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.45,0:15:19.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do they know who they're\Ndealing with here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.65,0:15:21.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be afraid when I tell you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.29,0:15:22.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, be very afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.20,0:15:24.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am the incredible Captain Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.59,0:15:26.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.50,0:15:27.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's you, Vivi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.42,0:15:28.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So were you able to find the cannon here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.57,0:15:29.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.48,0:15:30.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I figured it out. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.77,0:15:31.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know where?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.67,0:15:33.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.03,0:15:35.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll go ahead and signal everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.89,0:15:37.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're sure about this, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.27,0:15:39.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Special attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.97,0:15:40.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Red surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.85,0:16:11.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.09,0:16:20.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I slept good. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.19,0:16:22.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.25,0:16:23.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't move all of a sudden,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.59,0:16:25.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I decided to risk\Nit and take a nap right
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.73,0:16:28.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,here since there was\Nreally no other choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.79,0:16:33.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and I feel better now. So...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.51,0:16:37.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time for me to beat up Crocodile!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.39,0:16:48.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That hole over there looks kind of...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.13,0:16:52.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,kind of crockish.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.57,0:16:57.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's with this freaky place anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.09,0:17:00.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The whole thing is crumbling into pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.57,0:17:12.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm certain of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.25,0:17:14.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The cannon has to be in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.87,0:17:17.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't think of any other\Noptions besides that place.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.51,0:17:20.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What makes you so sure that\Nit's in there anyway, Phoebe?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.45,0:17:23.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to assume that this\Ndust devil is part of the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.83,0:17:25.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The cannon must be in a place where they
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.49,0:17:28.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can still see well\Nenough to hit the target.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.15,0:17:31.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.06,0:17:34.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it has to be in an open\Nspace where a cannon can fit,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.29,0:17:36.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but where it can't be seen from the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.65,0:17:38.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place is big enough, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.55,0:17:42.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So then let's make it the clan's\Nsecret base, what do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.83,0:17:43.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.93,0:17:45.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that has to be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.39,0:17:46.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It makes perfect sense to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.95,0:17:47.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.93,0:17:50.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll leave the others a message\Nsince you're headed this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.39,0:17:51.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.30,0:17:52.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going ahead to the tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.43,0:17:54.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.34,0:17:56.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, Vivi! Wait! Hurry! Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.71,0:17:57.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.09,0:17:59.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.35,0:18:00.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We found her, boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.13,0:18:05.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that was just too easy.\NThe signal led us right to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.69,0:18:08.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are more members of\Nthe Baroque Works Billions.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.87,0:18:09.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.05,0:18:11.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We signaled the enemy too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.71,0:18:15.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That smoke, Zuzab's signal,\Nhe must have found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.61,0:18:17.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, but why is the palace so far away?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.95,0:18:21.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good, it's not far from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.77,0:18:24.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if that signal means\Nthat they found the cannoneer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.73,0:18:26.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They must have, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.99,0:18:28.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.49,0:18:30.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.40,0:18:31.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Noisy attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.41,0:18:42.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trimble at the power of my nails!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.35,0:18:43.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, baby, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.63,0:18:46.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, over there! Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.47,0:19:09.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it's you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.67,0:19:11.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.95,0:19:13.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.21,0:19:16.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are you still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.49,0:19:20.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter how many times I kill you,\Nyou just keep coming back for more.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.85,0:19:23.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, answer me, brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.47,0:19:24.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did he do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.79,0:19:29.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did he do it? If you live\Nand come here, who is this boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.03,0:19:37.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.55,0:19:43.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, just how many\Ntimes do you have to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.61,0:19:46.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something you still\Nneed to return, Crocodile,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.33,0:19:48.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I came here to get it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.69,0:19:50.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this thing I took?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.29,0:19:54.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it money?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.53,0:19:55.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it fame?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.67,0:19:57.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or people's trust?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.27,0:19:58.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their lives?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.41,0:19:59.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it rain?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.63,0:20:05.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have taken all of those things.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.95,0:20:09.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So which is it that you want\Nme to give back, Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.43,0:20:10.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This land.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.39,0:20:12.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The land?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.61,0:20:14.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really, you should know\Nbetter than that by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.95,0:20:17.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no intention of\Nrelinquishing this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.75,0:20:21.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would I, when I'm going to\Nbecome its next king before long?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.85,0:20:25.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We came to this island\Nto save Vivi's country,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.59,0:20:27.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but then, when we got here, it was gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.31,0:20:29.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You stole her country!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.21,0:20:36.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to get to the rebel army.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.65,0:20:40.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must persuade their leader to stop\Nall of this pointless bloodshed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.59,0:20:43.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Up until a few short years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.49,0:20:47.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it was a thriving city full of gardens\Nand palm trees and lush greenery.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.31,0:20:55.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Vivi, you have to stop these\Nfools from tearing our country apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.47,0:20:59.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is her country, and I'm\Nhere to take it back from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.49,0:21:02.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then what's wrong with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.47,0:21:05.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's so very wrong about\Nnot wanting people to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.61,0:21:10.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just being in this country one day and\Ntaking a look around, even I can tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.85,0:21:14.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What this country needs\Nmore than anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.51,0:21:17.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think that putting\Njust your life on the
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.95,0:21:20.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,line is enough to stop\Nthis from happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.23,0:21:21.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.63,0:21:26.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have anything else\NI can put on the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.41,0:21:27.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.79,0:21:33.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you can at least try putting\Nall of our lives on the line together!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.75,0:21:35.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't we friends, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.45,0:21:42.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will defeat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.93,0:21:44.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take this country out of your evil hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.05,0:21:47.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then, Vivi will smile again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.81,0:21:52.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Threaten me as much as you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.65,0:21:54.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But without any water, you're nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.89,0:22:07.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.63,0:22:10.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He doesn't have any water,\Nso how can he kick me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.23,0:22:16.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is your fault, you monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.91,0:22:20.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This country would be peaceful\Nif it weren't for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.33,0:22:22.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's heartbreaking, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.05,0:22:27.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their love for their kingdom\Nwill be what destroys it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.23,0:22:55.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see you're using your blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.47,0:22:58.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.07,0:23:02.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blood can harden sand too, can't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.53,0:23:18.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First rain base, and then the royal\Npalace, and now, this underground temple.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.85,0:23:24.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should be rewarded for your\Ninsistence on challenging me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.71,0:23:28.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even after I've put you through hell\Ntwice now, you keep coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.97,0:23:34.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a pirate, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.99,0:23:40.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've certainly proven that in your\Ndetermination to defeat me, no matter the cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.69,0:23:43.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'll admit that you've\Nbecome an annoyingly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.09,0:23:45.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,persistent opponent during\Nour three encounters.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.31,0:23:47.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.39,0:23:48.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.59,0:23:51.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A poisonous hook.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.59,0:23:52.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.83,0:23:55.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You seem to be a competent\Npirate, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.89,0:23:58.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So surely you must understand\Nthat a duel between
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.85,0:24:02.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pirates is always about two\Npeople fighting for survival.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.65,0:24:06.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And when that's the case, there's\Nno such thing as playing dirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.07,0:24:15.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the explosion happens in the square,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.81,0:24:18.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this place will most\Nlikely crumble to dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.57,0:24:20.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This will be our final battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.75,0:24:22.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So let's settle this once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.49,0:24:29.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Smoke was coming from\Nthis direction, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.27,0:24:32.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.23,0:24:37.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? The Marines? Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.35,0:24:38.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Roro Noa Saru!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.53,0:24:39.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just great.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.44,0:24:41.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't realize the Marines\Nwere in this town now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.57,0:24:43.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have time for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.83,0:24:44.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.81,0:24:47.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I have no choice but\Nto deal with them quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.33,0:24:49.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you here in the\Nmiddle of the battlefield?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.57,0:24:51.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what do you think you're doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.23,0:24:53.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I could say the same thing to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.57,0:24:54.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold it, Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.69,0:24:55.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.81,0:24:58.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you head north at the next corner,\Nthen you can reach the Palace Square.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.87,0:25:00.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go back and turn right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.47,0:25:01.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.39,0:25:04.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you that stupid?\NStupid. Get out of here! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.69,0:25:06.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.65,0:25:07.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How it just...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.87,0:25:09.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to run faster, BB!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.05,0:25:11.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think I can, or something!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.87,0:25:13.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let the princess get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.19,0:25:14.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our promotions are on the...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.67,0:25:15.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.01,0:25:17.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.69,0:25:18.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.60,0:25:19.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ah! Ah! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.17,0:25:29.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.61,0:25:32.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.15,0:25:35.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're here to help you, not fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.29,0:25:37.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go stop the explosion in the square, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.79,0:25:38.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now go, quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.97,0:25:40.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get going, Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.33,0:25:41.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.24,0:25:42.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.47,0:25:58.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry, we have to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.57,0:26:00.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've wasted a lot of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.33,0:26:02.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know why they\Nhelped us back there,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.17,0:26:05.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but if it weren't for the Marines,\Nwe'd be a lot worse off now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.49,0:26:17.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, don't look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.43,0:26:18.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have time to help them.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.03,0:26:22.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we don't stop the explosion, the\Ncasualties would be a lot worse than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.89,0:26:23.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.85,0:26:27.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crying about it isn't going to\Nstop the attack from happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.15,0:26:34.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In two minutes, we're either going\Nto beat them or we're going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.43,0:26:36.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We still have time left. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.63,0:26:38.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we're all helping you. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.95,0:26:44.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.31,0:26:46.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Phoebe, who's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.31,0:26:48.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Nami and Tony.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.83,0:26:50.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.03,0:26:52.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Marines just helped us out back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.95,0:26:54.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Were you able to find where the cannon is?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.89,0:26:58.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We haven't confirmed it yet, but\Nthis is the only place it can be.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.47,0:27:01.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We must have passed it a bunch\Nof times before I realized it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.31,0:27:02.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The cannon is up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.79,0:27:04.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm absolutely sure of it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.97,0:27:12.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The clock tower? I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.47,0:27:15.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From up there, he can get a\Nreally good shot at the square.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.17,0:27:16.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We still need Pel to get here, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.01,0:27:18.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the only way to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.45,0:27:20.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pel.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.45,0:27:30.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.25,0:27:36.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could have sworn I saw the smoke coming\Nup from somewhere around this area.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.79,0:27:39.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robot, Robot, Robot, Robot.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.53,0:27:40.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.89,0:27:44.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just shot down that big\Nbird with my Robot, Robot gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.33,0:27:45.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quite impressive, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.71,0:27:51.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.91,0:28:14.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ohhhhhhhhhh
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.63,0:28:17.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.45,0:28:20.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hiyori!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.85,0:28:41.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.01,0:29:02.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.33,0:29:45.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's so strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.67,0:29:47.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who in the world is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.71,0:29:50.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crocodile made even our best\Nwarriors look like children.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.91,0:29:52.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now he's actually struggling.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.51,0:30:04.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were skewered, buried\Nalive, and dried up.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.17,0:30:10.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may have made it through all that,\Nbut you won't escape this time, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.09,0:30:12.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no hope for survival.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.19,0:30:14.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The game is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.77,0:30:17.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This poison will spread through you soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.79,0:30:20.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, crocodile, you\Njust don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.73,0:30:24.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.15,0:30:28.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't see Pell anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.89,0:30:32.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I don't think there's\Nany way we can get to the
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.43,0:30:34.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,top of the tower in less than\Na minute without any help?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.75,0:30:35.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.07,0:30:36.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.98,0:30:38.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we need you But now we're\Ngoing to have to get moving
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.85,0:30:41.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,without him We're gonna have\Nto climb all these stairs,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.59,0:30:42.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you guys ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.01,0:30:43.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.92,0:30:44.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.84,0:30:45.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.01,0:30:46.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Vivi!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.73,0:30:49.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji, what are you doing\Nall the way up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.07,0:30:51.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.23,0:30:54.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You left a message where\Nthe smoke was, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.57,0:30:56.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The message said go to the clock tower,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.87,0:30:59.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I figured I'd better\Nhead up here to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.17,0:31:00.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.77,0:31:03.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's the cannoneer? The top!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.31,0:31:04.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's at the top!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.51,0:31:06.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go up from there and take him down!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.57,0:31:08.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.19,0:31:13.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, where were you? I was\Nlooking! Zoro? You're here, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.61,0:31:15.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.53,0:31:17.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Funny, I was gonna ask you the same thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.75,0:31:18.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was the Marines!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.66,0:31:20.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I kept saying, go north, go north!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.65,0:31:23.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I just kept going north\Ntill I got all the way up here!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.27,0:31:25.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,North and up aren't the same thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.67,0:31:27.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, good job, you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.57,0:31:30.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now just keep on going up from there\Nand destroy the clock tower, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.97,0:31:31.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.25,0:31:35.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They can't get inside the clock\Ntower from where they are now.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.49,0:31:37.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, there are only two ways in.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.63,0:31:40.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The back stairs on the first\Nfloor and from the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.25,0:31:41.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why we need Pell!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.79,0:31:44.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But can't Zoro just go ahead and\Ndestroy the wall or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.55,0:31:45.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't risk that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.61,0:31:48.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It could make the cannonball explode\Neven earlier for all we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.65,0:31:50.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have no choice but to take the stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.95,0:31:52.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, wait, Vivi!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.27,0:31:55.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I have a better plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.63,0:32:12.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, Mr. Seven,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.41,0:32:14.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,according to what the boss told us,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.33,0:32:17.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this is going to be our final\Nmission for Baroque Works!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.41,0:32:18.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robot!
