Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.32,0:32:19.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robot!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.24,0:32:20.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robot!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.51,0:32:22.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right, Miss Father's Day!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.29,0:32:27.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,According to the plan, we have\Njust 30 seconds left to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.81,0:32:31.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are they? Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.23,0:32:34.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seven and Miss Father's Day.

